          "text": "    rdfs:comment \"A 3GPP Technical Specification (TS) or Technical Report (TR). v4.1 (release-aware, hybrid) — a Spec exists in two roles. (1) ABSTRACT HUB: one node per specNumber (IRI tdoc:spec/{specNumber_}, e.g. tdoc:spec/38_211), no tdoc:specRelease; the stable target of release-blind document references — Tdoc/CR MODIFIES & AFFECTS_CORE_SPEC, TRImpact IMPACTS_SPEC/SPEC_IMPACTED_BY (a CR modifies 'the spec', not a single release). (2) RELEASE-KEYED: one node per (specNumber, release) (IRI tdoc:spec/{specNumber_}/{release}, e.g. tdoc:spec/38_211/Rel-15), carries tdoc:specInRelease + tdoc:specRelease + that release's specVersion; the parent of release-specific Sections (BELONGS_TO_SPEC/HAS_SECTION); linked to its hub via tdoc:inReleaseOf. This hybrid preserves release-blind reference edges intact (no re-keying) while giving each release's Sections a release-keyed parent. Pre-v4.0 had a single specNumber node (latest snapshot); v4.0 had only release-keyed nodes (broke hub references) — v4.1 restores the hub additively.\"@en ."
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 154,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 338,
          "text": "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 339,
          "text": "# CR-specific Object Property (1)"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 340,
          "text": "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 341,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 342,
          "text": "tdoc:modifies a owl:ObjectProperty ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 343,
          "text": "    rdfs:label \"modifies\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 344,
          "text": "    rdfs:comment \"Specification(s) that this CR modifies. Cardinality 1..*: a single CR may amend more than one Spec (e.g., paired stage-2 and stage-3 updates).\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 345,
          "text": "    rdfs:domain tdoc:CR ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 346,
          "text": "    rdfs:range tdoc:Spec ."
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 347,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 348,
          "text": "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 475,
          "text": "    rdfs:range tdoc:Spec ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 476,
          "text": "    owl:inverseOf tdoc:hasSection ."
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 477,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 478,
          "text": "tdoc:hasSubSection a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:IrreflexiveProperty, owl:AsymmetricProperty ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 479,
          "text": "    rdfs:label \"has sub-section\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 480,
          "text": "    rdfs:comment \"Direct child Section(s) of this Section\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 481,
          "text": "    rdfs:domain tdoc:Section ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 482,
          "text": "    rdfs:range tdoc:Section ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 483,
          "text": "    owl:inverseOf tdoc:parentSection ."
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 484,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 485,
          "text": "tdoc:parentSection a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty, owl:IrreflexiveProperty, owl:AsymmetricProperty ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 486,
          "text": "    rdfs:label \"parent section\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 487,
          "text": "    rdfs:comment \"Direct parent Section (exactly one, null for level-1)\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 488,
          "text": "    rdfs:domain tdoc:Section ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 489,
          "text": "    rdfs:range tdoc:Section ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 490,
          "text": "    owl:inverseOf tdoc:hasSubSection ."
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 491,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 492,
          "text": "tdoc:referencesSection a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:IrreflexiveProperty ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 493,
          "text": "    rdfs:label \"references section\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 849,
          "text": "tdoc:clausesAffected a owl:DatatypeProperty ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 850,
          "text": "    rdfs:label \"clauses affected\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 851,
          "text": "    rdfs:comment \"Specification clauses affected by this CR (e.g., '5.3.1, 5.3.2')\"@en ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 852,
          "text": "    rdfs:domain tdoc:CR ;"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 853,
          "text": "    rdfs:range xsd:string ."
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 854,
          "text": ""
        }
